WEBVTT

00:02.394 --> 00:04.694
shinjitai
I want to believe

00:04.834 --> 00:07.864
ano hi mitsuketa hikari
In the light that I found that day

00:08.374 --> 00:11.104
kimi to kawashita
Because I still have

00:11.104 --> 00:15.734
tatta hitotsuno yakusoku ga arukara
That one promise that I made to you

00:16.174 --> 00:23.144
mou tachidomarazuni aruite yukitai
I want to keep walking, never stopping

00:24.884 --> 00:27.754
Dragon Drive

00:27.754 --> 00:33.254
uresugita kajitsu wo kajiru youni
Like biting into an overripe fruit

00:33.394 --> 00:36.364
yowai jibun ni
I was spoiling myself

00:36.364 --> 00:39.594
amaetsuzukete ita
I was giving in to my weakness

00:40.104 --> 00:44.474
kimi ni deawanakereba
If I hadn't met you

00:44.474 --> 00:46.444
ima mo
I'd still...

00:46.444 --> 00:52.744
kabe wo kowasu koto nado dekinakatta yo
...be unable to break the walls around me

00:54.484 --> 00:56.854
wasurenai
I'll never forget

00:56.854 --> 01:00.054
ano hi kanjita itami
The pain that I felt that day

01:00.394 --> 01:05.394
nido to ano basho modoritakunai
I never want to go back to that place

01:05.394 --> 01:06.954
motto tsuyoku
This strong feeling

01:07.094 --> 01:09.494
shinjitai
I want to believe

01:09.494 --> 01:12.624
ano hi mitsuketa hikari
In the light I found that day

01:13.034 --> 01:18.104
kakkowarui to warawaretemo ii
Let them laugh and call me a loser

01:18.104 --> 01:20.844
bukiyou dakara
Because I'm clumsy

01:20.844 --> 01:28.514
onaji ikikata shika erabenainda
I can only choose to live life this way

01:41.934 --> 01:45.334
This means we can go to the next level?

01:45.334 --> 01:46.024
Wrong!

01:48.104 --> 01:50.274
You fell for it! You fell for it!

01:50.274 --> 01:54.304
You really are a fool,
to believe such an obvious lie!

01:56.474 --> 01:58.204
How dare they call Daisuke trash?

02:03.984 --> 02:05.474
Don't you insult him!

02:09.594 --> 02:10.714
It's frightening.

02:10.824 --> 02:13.494
No! Reiji Ohzora.

02:13.494 --> 02:17.224
You must not draw out
the power of Senkohcoola with anger!

02:17.434 --> 02:21.204
It is not the kind of power
fit for the guardian spirit, Senkohcoola!

02:21.604 --> 02:26.734
Is this young man still too immature
to handle Senkohcoola?

02:28.014 --> 02:29.874
I'll finish you off!

02:32.584 --> 02:35.644
Proof of Trust

02:40.354 --> 02:41.884
Fire away, Kashinki!

02:55.504 --> 02:57.494
What's the matter, Kashinki?! Fire away!

03:13.054 --> 03:16.084
There's no way that Master Lin
and Miss Sue could lose.

03:16.624 --> 03:18.824
But... perhaps...

03:19.624 --> 03:21.834
Here we go!

03:21.834 --> 03:22.524
Chibi!

03:25.134 --> 03:26.294
This is it!

03:52.664 --> 03:54.564
Miss Sue! Master Lin!

03:58.004 --> 04:00.564
I've got to go find Daisuke.

04:01.204 --> 04:02.294
Let's go, Chibi!

04:34.704 --> 04:37.534
I can feel Chibi's pain!

04:47.084 --> 04:50.614
This is what happens
when you worry about others.

04:51.024 --> 04:55.284
For a fool like you
who believes in fighting for others...

04:55.424 --> 04:57.354
...we will use the Sol Edge and Luna Edge...

04:57.694 --> 05:00.354
...to give you a taste of true fear!

05:07.074 --> 05:10.504
Wh-What is that dark shadow
behind those twins?!

05:36.634 --> 05:40.064
These are the true forms
of En-Ouji and Kashinki.

05:41.074 --> 05:42.734
You mustn't, Miss Sue! Master Lin!

05:42.904 --> 05:46.344
Your bodies will not be able
to withstand the power of those parts!

05:46.344 --> 05:48.434
Please! Don't do it!

05:49.444 --> 05:50.784
Wow!

05:50.784 --> 05:54.774
I never thought they'd use
dragon parts in a place like this.

05:55.684 --> 05:58.184
Yeah, but those twins are really useless.

05:58.184 --> 06:00.624
Hey, how much longer
are we going to be here?

06:02.554 --> 06:04.424
Take it easy. Just relax.

06:05.394 --> 06:08.854
This is important data-gathering
for the games, after all.

06:09.464 --> 06:11.604
I'm doing pretty good here.

06:11.604 --> 06:13.774
Working hard for RI-ON.

06:13.774 --> 06:15.394
You should both appreciate that.

06:28.184 --> 06:31.184
You don't have much to back up
that blustery attitude.

06:31.184 --> 06:34.154
I guess you're just all talk in the end.

06:35.454 --> 06:38.054
Damn! I'll definitely defeat you!

06:40.794 --> 06:42.894
Don't insult me!

06:45.064 --> 06:47.004
Wh-What's going on?

06:47.004 --> 06:49.634
They were thrown around so easily before.

06:49.634 --> 06:52.074
But now they can hold
Chibi's power back with one hand.

06:57.844 --> 06:58.904
I'm getting bored.

07:00.184 --> 07:02.344
We should bring it to a close.

07:13.394 --> 07:16.464
Well, what do you think
of the Blue Flame Maelstrom?

07:16.464 --> 07:19.954
Don't worry, we'll make sure
that you get your fill.

07:43.894 --> 07:46.024
I can't believe I'm no match for them.

07:46.424 --> 07:51.734
Even after Chibi powered up for me!

08:09.454 --> 08:10.474
Chibi!

08:13.524 --> 08:14.954
What's the matter?!

08:14.954 --> 08:16.424
Why are you back in your normal form?

08:16.754 --> 08:18.424
We'll be finished off this way!

08:18.794 --> 08:20.924
How are we going to avenge Daisuke?!

08:21.534 --> 08:22.864
Chibi!

08:23.564 --> 08:25.794
I don't know what to do.

08:28.074 --> 08:33.234
Daisuke, I'm trying
to claim revenge for you.

08:34.444 --> 08:37.434
But why can't I defeat them?

08:45.884 --> 08:46.854
This is it.

09:13.784 --> 09:14.844
This is it.

09:26.324 --> 09:28.494
Y-You're...

09:34.804 --> 09:36.274
You're that dragon from the other day!

09:40.574 --> 09:44.534
Oh, my, here's that useless,
good-for-nothing fool.

09:46.184 --> 09:48.274
We can finish him off, too.

09:49.984 --> 09:52.254
Don't! You can't handle it! Stop this!

09:56.294 --> 09:58.954
Just run away! You're finally free!

10:03.094 --> 10:05.434
Think of the horrible things they did to you!

10:10.304 --> 10:11.604
Master Ohzora!

10:12.874 --> 10:14.144
I have a favor to ask!

10:14.144 --> 10:15.904
Wh-What are you?!

10:16.174 --> 10:18.374
Please save Miss Sue and Master Lin!

10:19.244 --> 10:20.214
Those two?!

10:20.584 --> 10:25.024
After all of those insults,
you must be wondering about my words.

10:25.384 --> 10:26.214
But...

10:26.524 --> 10:29.494
...there's nothing more that I can do now.

10:30.454 --> 10:32.524
I will tell you the truth about what happened.

10:32.524 --> 10:35.464
Miss Sue and Master Lin
have been manipulated by RI-ON...

10:35.464 --> 10:40.424
...and a dragon named Darks
possesses their bodies and controls them.

10:41.034 --> 10:45.874
In order to ensure
that the twins' lives are spared...

10:46.244 --> 10:49.704
...I have had no choice
but to follow RI-ON's orders.

10:56.484 --> 11:02.444
Darks has been growing day by day,
feeding on the darkness within the children.

11:03.024 --> 11:06.824
Their bodies will not last much longer.

11:07.664 --> 11:09.564
Please save them!

11:17.844 --> 11:20.334
Puu-Suke! Puu-Suke?!

11:23.174 --> 11:25.384
It's too late!

11:25.384 --> 11:28.514
The bodies of these kids are already mine.

11:28.514 --> 11:31.184
And you let out a big secret, lady.

11:31.184 --> 11:33.024
That's against the rules, you know.

11:33.024 --> 11:35.754
In RI-ON terms, you're history.

11:36.154 --> 11:38.364
I don't care what happens to me!

11:38.364 --> 11:41.994
I just don't want Miss Sue
and Master Lin to suffer anymore!

11:42.294 --> 11:43.594
Hmm...

11:43.594 --> 11:45.664
So, you'll go against RI-ON?

11:45.664 --> 11:47.534
You've got a lot of guts.

11:49.034 --> 11:50.134
RI-ON.

11:51.044 --> 11:52.434
These young twins...

11:53.304 --> 11:55.934
...me, Maiko, Daisuke...

11:56.744 --> 11:59.614
...all deceived by a game called Dragon Drive.
And Meguru...

11:59.614 --> 12:02.584
...forced to come to Rikyu as a fighter.

12:04.054 --> 12:07.854
Using kids as pawns
for whatever they please.

12:10.024 --> 12:12.664
What is RI-ON trying to do?!

12:12.664 --> 12:15.634
Oh, so you wanna go at it?
You're gonna take me on?

12:15.934 --> 12:20.304
I am going to protect everyone!

12:22.404 --> 12:24.374
I will definitely save you!

12:25.174 --> 12:29.344
It'll be best for you
if you don't even try to do that.

12:29.344 --> 12:30.074
Yes.

12:31.144 --> 12:35.884
Well, I didn't think they had
anything left of their own will.

12:38.684 --> 12:43.384
Just like you, many grownups
have come to try to save us.

12:43.994 --> 12:46.864
But it was no good.

12:47.464 --> 12:50.124
They all abandoned us.

12:50.534 --> 12:52.834
They treated us like monsters.

12:52.834 --> 12:55.894
Even our mother and father abandoned us.

13:03.944 --> 13:06.184
The strict rules and manners
we had to abide by.

13:06.184 --> 13:09.174
The suffocating days
spent living in fear of our parents.

13:10.184 --> 13:12.784
We were wearing masks
with smiles painted on them.

13:12.784 --> 13:16.384
We were tired of playing the part
of good children.

13:37.044 --> 13:40.074
You want to leave this cage,
don't you, little birdies?

13:43.584 --> 13:46.314
Wanna take a look
at what's outside the cage?

13:50.924 --> 13:52.564
What's the matter?

13:52.564 --> 13:54.224
Don't you want to leave?

13:57.064 --> 13:58.124
The outside is...

14:00.464 --> 14:02.904
...a lot of fun!

14:05.044 --> 14:08.404
But once you go to look,
you can never return.

14:12.414 --> 14:14.754
No one would care about us.

14:14.754 --> 14:17.184
No one would try to save us.

14:18.154 --> 14:19.954
That's why...

14:19.954 --> 14:23.114
...we won't believe in anybody!

14:23.494 --> 14:24.584
Is that true?

14:27.164 --> 14:28.634
You really believe in no one?

14:31.464 --> 14:33.124
Then why are you crying?

14:40.444 --> 14:41.934
Why are you crying?

14:42.474 --> 14:45.084
You act as though
you've given up on everything.

14:45.084 --> 14:46.274
But it isn't so!

14:48.254 --> 14:50.374
You really want to believe in someone!

14:50.754 --> 14:52.154
N-No!

14:54.854 --> 14:57.524
Why do you think
Sally told me about RI-ON...

14:57.524 --> 14:59.894
...knowing that she might be killed for it?

15:00.864 --> 15:02.554
It's because she wants to save you!

15:02.664 --> 15:04.094
That can't be true!

15:04.094 --> 15:06.824
She couldn't do that!

15:07.064 --> 15:08.334
You have to believe!

15:10.274 --> 15:11.504
Believe!

15:16.174 --> 15:17.544
You have to trust me!

15:29.654 --> 15:32.594
I will save you!

15:33.624 --> 15:35.114
I remember, Chibi.

15:35.494 --> 15:39.194
I remember what that old lady told me
when she sent us out here.

15:40.064 --> 15:43.434
Senkohcoola draws its power
from righteousness.

15:43.934 --> 15:48.344
How that power is drawn out
all depends on you.

15:49.544 --> 15:50.984
That's right.

15:50.984 --> 15:52.444
It's a legendary guardian spirit.

15:53.014 --> 15:55.274
A dragon that protects people.

15:55.914 --> 16:00.524
Before, I was full of thoughts
of revenge for Daisuke.

16:00.524 --> 16:02.784
And I fought, filled with anger.

16:04.524 --> 16:09.124
But that's not your real power, is it, Chibi?

16:11.334 --> 16:15.294
Not the power of hate and anger...

16:15.934 --> 16:19.404
...but the power to save people.

16:19.404 --> 16:24.434
That's the power that must be drawn
from the guardian spirit, Senkohcoola.

16:27.444 --> 16:29.574
I understand now. Sorry, Chibi.

16:31.784 --> 16:34.554
Let's go and save those two
from Darks, Chibi!

16:56.074 --> 16:59.634
It's a real hassle, but I'll tell you anyway.

17:00.084 --> 17:03.854
You see, I'm a dragon.
And yet, I'm not a dragon.

17:03.854 --> 17:07.084
It's like I have form and I don't.

17:07.354 --> 17:10.624
Do you understand now? I bet you don't.

17:13.294 --> 17:15.554
What's he going on about now?

17:15.734 --> 17:19.004
I can materialize the darkness
within people's spirits.

17:19.004 --> 17:23.564
There's no way for you
to find an effective attack against me!

17:24.444 --> 17:27.134
How about I eat you, too?

17:27.744 --> 17:31.044
There's no rush! I'll give you plenty to eat!

17:35.484 --> 17:36.954
What's this light?!

17:36.954 --> 17:39.614
I-It feels creepy!

17:40.324 --> 17:43.954
A dragon born out of darkness
ought to be weak against the power of good.

17:45.124 --> 17:46.994
D-Don't you mess with me.

17:46.994 --> 17:50.024
You think that light can?

17:50.164 --> 17:52.724
Vanish into the light! Darks!

17:59.204 --> 18:04.944
Th-This can't be happening!

18:28.174 --> 18:33.304
They say Darks will always possess
those who have a weakness in their spirit.

18:33.804 --> 18:37.504
These children must have had
weak spirits as well.

18:38.214 --> 18:41.184
As their guardian,
I should have been more aware.

18:42.584 --> 18:46.454
Then you'll just have to keep on
taking care of them.

18:46.984 --> 18:50.654
The fact that they kept you at their side
even after they were possessed by Darks...

18:51.394 --> 18:54.624
...means that they must've trusted you.

18:58.004 --> 18:59.194
Yes.

19:00.804 --> 19:01.994
Master Ohzora.

19:03.304 --> 19:08.744
RI-ON is after a treasure that possesses
a divine power here on Rikyu.

19:08.744 --> 19:10.434
The Dragonite.

19:11.984 --> 19:13.604
Please be careful.

19:14.514 --> 19:15.714
Thank you.

19:16.984 --> 19:19.014
I'm counting on you, too, Puu-Suke!

19:20.854 --> 19:21.824
Hey!

19:22.054 --> 19:24.754
That was pretty cool there, Reiji.

19:27.694 --> 19:28.854
Daisuke!

19:29.294 --> 19:30.664
You're alive!

19:30.894 --> 19:32.894
I was really worried about you!

19:35.504 --> 19:37.064
I win, Reiji!

19:38.444 --> 19:41.274
This guy got blasted and fell, right?

19:41.414 --> 19:42.374
Yeah?

19:43.974 --> 19:45.114
And wouldn't you know it?

19:45.114 --> 19:47.704
Some poor bastard got squished underneath.

19:48.414 --> 19:53.544
He just happened to have a glowing stone,
the ticket to get to the next level.

19:57.864 --> 19:58.954
Don't laugh!

19:59.294 --> 20:01.354
You win, my foot!

20:02.094 --> 20:06.324
As we agreed, you have to hand over
Maiko's special amulet to me!

20:07.764 --> 20:08.964
Give it!

20:09.334 --> 20:12.234
In any case, at least we managed
to get through the preliminaries.

20:12.744 --> 20:15.014
But the real battle is only just beginning.

20:15.014 --> 20:19.314
- This is too funny!
- I want it! I want it! Maiko's special amulet!

20:25.584 --> 20:27.154
He'd better remember!

20:27.154 --> 20:29.314
That bastard!

20:30.224 --> 20:33.224
You've gotten quite a bit smaller,
haven't you, Darks?

20:33.224 --> 20:34.524
Kouhei!

20:34.994 --> 20:38.134
That jerk! That jerk was so mean to me!
He really hurt me!

20:38.134 --> 20:40.624
I'm never going to forgive him!
I'll never forgive him!

20:40.834 --> 20:42.324
I'll make sure he pays!

20:42.834 --> 20:45.394
You just watch!

20:46.044 --> 20:47.004
Yeah, yeah.

20:47.504 --> 20:50.174
What a disappointment you've been.

20:50.444 --> 20:53.884
That's why I told you
not to underestimate him, Kouhei.

20:54.784 --> 20:57.754
We're the only ones
who can be his true opponents.

21:14.364 --> 21:19.464
To think that only children
of a certain age can go to Rikyu.

21:21.244 --> 21:22.674
The Dragonite.

21:23.774 --> 21:26.784
By using the power
sealed within that stone...

21:26.784 --> 21:33.344
...we chosen humans must usher in
a new era to the dying Earth.

21:34.794 --> 21:36.194
Earth and Rikyu.

21:36.194 --> 21:40.284
I will make both worlds mine,
and rule them both.

21:56.974 --> 21:59.714
taikutsu datta
I was bored

21:59.714 --> 22:02.484
okubyou datta
I was a coward

22:02.484 --> 22:06.424
dareka wo jibun wo kizutsukete ita
I was hurting someone and myself

22:07.884 --> 22:10.654
tsuyogari itte
I tried to hide my weakness

22:10.654 --> 22:12.824
wagamama itte
I was being selfish

22:13.294 --> 22:17.394
doushiyoumonai kimochi mamoritsuzukete
Protecting the uncontrollable feeling

22:18.834 --> 22:21.504
otona ni natte
I became an adult

22:21.504 --> 22:24.234
kimi to deatte
Then I met you

22:24.234 --> 22:28.194
mune no sumikko yawarakaku natte
My heart got softened

22:29.544 --> 22:32.044
setsunaku natta
Longing for love

22:32.044 --> 22:35.054
dakishime atta
We embraced each other

22:35.054 --> 22:39.914
hakkiri mamorubeki mono wo mitsuketa
I finally knew what I wanted to protect

22:40.584 --> 22:43.324
tatta hitotsu no yuuki ga
Only one courage

22:43.324 --> 22:46.094
tatta hitotsu no kotoba ga
Just one word

22:46.094 --> 22:50.724
futari owaranai yume e to hakobu
Take us to an endless dream

22:51.464 --> 22:54.234
hon no chiisana yasashisa ga
Only a small kindness

22:54.234 --> 22:56.904
hon no wazuka na sasayaki ga
Only a small whisper

22:56.904 --> 23:01.534
futari wo sotto tsutsunde kureru
Wrap us gently

23:02.214 --> 23:06.704
zutto konomama asa ga kurumade
Until the morning comes

23:07.644 --> 23:13.314
zutto konomama asa ga kurumade
Until the morning comes

23:15.794 --> 23:18.314
Next Episode

23:18.764 --> 23:21.884
Well, thank goodness we managed
to get through the preliminary!

23:22.794 --> 23:23.834
That's right.

23:23.834 --> 23:27.234
Daisuke was hurt badly
and can't fight the next battle.

23:27.934 --> 23:29.994
What? Maiko's going to take his place?!

23:31.104 --> 23:32.674
But Rockaku was against it...

23:32.674 --> 23:35.434
...and so she got all sulky
and decided to walk across a desert?!

23:35.914 --> 23:38.814
Next time on Dragon Drive,
"As You Are".

23:40.244 --> 23:42.684
What?! Maiko's being attacked
by thirty thousand dragons in the desert?!

23:42.684 --> 23:44.314
As You Are
What?! Maiko's being attacked
by thirty thousand dragons in the desert?!

23:44.314 --> 23:45.344
As You Are
